  "description": {
    "text": "A collection launched on 19 June 2026 with nine illustration rare–style promos of the first partners of Johto, Unova and Galar. Each collection held a pack of three of the nine, with two more booster packs and a sticker sheet. Side by side, each region's three cards make one long picture: Chikorita, Cyndaquil and Totodile of Johto, Snivy, Tepig and Oshawott of Unova, Grookey, Scorbunny and Sobble of Galar.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon: Pokémon TCG: First Partner Illustration Collection—Series 2",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.com/us/pokemon-tcg/product-gallery/first-partner-illustration-collection-series-2"
      }
    ]
  },
